{"id": "19-1890-2-6", "zh": "46. iṃ 也变为 siñ", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1891-2-9", "zh": "iṃ 可选地变为 siñ；mha 与 ttha 也多半如此。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1891-10-12", "zh": "siñ 中的 i 音和 ñ 音，分别是为了便于发音和表示它是加在前面的成分。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "19-1891-13-30", "zh": "例如：abhavasittha、bhavasittha，abhavittha、bhavittha，abhavattha、bhavattha，abhavisiṃ、bhavisiṃ，abhavasiṃ、bhavasiṃ，abhaviṃ、bhaviṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1891-31-34", "zh": "加入增音 u 时，ā 变为短音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1891-35-39", "zh": "例如：abhavumha、bhavumha，abhavumhā、bhavumhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1891-40-53", "zh": "加入增音 siñ 时：abhavasimha、bhavasimha，abhavasimhā、bhavasimhā，abhavimha、bhavimha，abhavimhā、bhavimhā，abhavamha、bhavamha，abhavamhā、bhavamhā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1891-54-55", "zh": "在后六词尾（反身态）中——", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1891-56-67", "zh": "依“eyyātha”等规则，在 ttha 的情况下：abhavittha、bhavittha，abhavattha、bhavattha。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "19-1891-68-77", "zh": "变为短音时：abhavatha、bhavatha，abhavā、bhavā，abhavu、bhavu。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1891-78-102", "zh": "abhavise、bhavise，abhavase、bhavase，abhavivhaṃ、bhavivhaṃ，abhavavhaṃ、bhavavhaṃ；a 被替换为 aṃ 时：abhavaṃ、bhavaṃ，abhava、bhava；abhavimhe、bhavimhe，abhavamhe、bhavamhe。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1891-103-121", "zh": "被动态：sukhaṃ tayā anubhūyittho（快乐被你经验了），以及 anvabhūyattho、anubhūyattho、anvabhūsi、anubhūsī、anvabhūyī、anubhūyī，anvabhūyiṃsu、anubhūyiṃsu、anvabhūyaṃsu、anubhūyaṃsu、anvabhūyuṃ、anubhūyuṃ 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1891-122-131", "zh": "无人称态：tena abhūyittho、bhūyittho，abhūyattho、bhūyattho，abhūyi、bhūyi，abhūyī、bhūyī。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1891-132-139", "zh": "tena abhūyattha、bhūyattha，abhūya、bhūya，abhūyā、bhūyā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1892-2-7", "zh": "so apacittho、pacittho 等，与主动态相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1892-8-12", "zh": "被动态：apacīyittho、pacīyittho，apacīyattho、pacīyattho。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1892-13-46", "zh": "按 c 组辅音前同化时：apaccittho、paccittho，apaccattho、paccattho，apacīyi、pacīyi，apacīyī、pacīyī，apacci、pacci，apaccī、paccī，apacīyiṃsu、pacīyiṃsu，apaciṃsu、paciṃsu，apacīyaṃsu、pacīyaṃsu，apaccaṃsu、paccaṃsu，apacīyuṃ、pacīyuṃ，apaccuṃ、paccuṃ 等，与主动态相同，区别只在于前同化。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1893-2-8", "zh": "so gāmaṃ agacchittho（他去了村子）、gacchittho 等，与前面的例子相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1894-2-6", "zh": "30. ḍaṃs 也变为 ñcha", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1895-2-12", "zh": "在 ā、ī 等词尾之前，ḍaṃs 和 gam 都可选地变为 ñcha。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1895-13-22", "zh": "例如：agañchittho、gañchittho，agañchattho、gañchattho，agañchi、gañchi，agañchī、gañchī 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1896-2-4", "zh": "29. gam 变为 ā", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1897-2-9", "zh": "在 ā 等词尾和 ī 等词尾之前，gam 可选地变为 ā。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1897-10-18", "zh": "so agā，agami、gami，agamittho、gamittho，agamattho、gamattho。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1897-19-60", "zh": "用 ī 词尾时，依“himimesvassā”这条规则中分立出来的“assā”，插入音 la 的 a 变为长音；再依“dīghā īssā”，ī 被替换为 si，得 agamāsi；又有 agami、gami，agamī、gamī，agamiṃsu、gamiṃsu，agamaṃsu、gamaṃsu，agamuṃ、gamuṃ。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "19-1897-61-64", "zh": "o 被替换为 a 时：ajjhaguṃ。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "19-1897-65-69", "zh": "tvaṃ ajjhagā（你证得了），后一个音删除。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1897-70-72", "zh": "tumhe ajjhaguttha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1897-73-78", "zh": "ahaṃ ajjhagaṃ，mayaṃ ajjhagamha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1897-79-80", "zh": "在后六词尾（反身态）中——", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1897-81-99", "zh": "依“eyyātha”等规则，在 ttha 的情况下：so agacchittha、gacchittha，agañchittha、gañchittha，agamittha、gamittha，agama、gama，agamā、gamā。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "19-1897-100-107", "zh": "te agamū、gamū；o 被替换为 ā 时：ajjhaguṃ。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "19-1897-108-111", "zh": "tvaṃ agamise、gamise。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1897-112-114", "zh": "tumhe agamivhaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1897-115-128", "zh": "依“eyyātha”等规则替换为 aṃ 时：ahaṃ agamaṃ、gamaṃ、ajjhagaṃ。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "19-1897-129-132", "zh": "mayaṃ agamimhe、gamimhe。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1897-133-139", "zh": "被动态：agacchīyi、agamīyi，agacchiyuṃ、agamiyuṃ 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1897-140-144", "zh": "同样还有 aghammī、ghammī 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1898-2-7", "zh": "13. 与 mā 连用时，用 ī 等与 ā 等词尾", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1899-2-10", "zh": "与 mā 连用时，可选地使用 ī 等词尾和 ā 等词尾。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1899-11-16", "zh": "这条规则的用意是：在这些词尾本来所属的时态之外，其他时态也可以用它们。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1899-17-21", "zh": "例如：mā bhavaṃ abhavittho（愿尊者不要成为）等。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1899-22-45", "zh": "由于规定是可选的，ssati 等、eyya 等、tu 等词尾也可以用：mā bhavaṃ bhavissati，mā bhavaṃ bhaveyya，mā bhavaṃ bhavatu 等。（ī 等词尾的用法完）", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1900-2-15", "zh": "5. 非今天的过去时用 ā、ū、o、ttha、a、mhā、ttha、tthuṃ、se、vhaṃ、iṃ、mhase", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1901-2-9", "zh": "表示不包括今天在内的过去义时，动词词根之后可选地加 ā 等词尾。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1901-10-41", "zh": "依“eyyātha”等规则在 ttha 的情况下，并依“ā ī ū mhā”等规则变为短音：so abhavattha、bhavattha，abhava、bhava，abhavā、bhavā；te abhavu、bhavu，abhavū、bhavū。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "19-1901-42-66", "zh": "o：依“ossā”等规则替换为 a 等：abhava、bhava，abhavi、bhavi，abhavattha、bhavattha，abhavattho、bhavattho；替换为 si 时：abhavasi、bhavasi，abhavo、bhavo。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "19-1901-67-70", "zh": "tumhe abhavattha、bhavattha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1901-71-82", "zh": "ahaṃ abhavaṃ、bhavaṃ，abhava、bhava；mayaṃ abhavamha、bhavamha，abhavamhā、bhavamhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1901-83-86", "zh": "so abhavattha、bhavattha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1901-87-90", "zh": "te abhavatthuṃ、bhavatthuṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1901-91-94", "zh": "tvaṃ abhavase、bhavase。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1901-95-98", "zh": "tumhe abhavavhaṃ、bhavavhaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1901-99-114", "zh": "依“iṃssa ca siñ”规则得 siṃ：ahaṃ abhavasiṃ、bhavasiṃ，abhaviṃ、bhaviṃ。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1901-115-118", "zh": "mayaṃ abhavamhase、bhavamhase。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1901-119-127", "zh": "被动态 ttha 的情况：sukhaṃ tayā anubhūyittha；不加增音 i 时：anubhūyattha 等。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1901-128-131", "zh": "无人称态：abhūyattha、bhūyattha 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1902-2-9", "zh": "so odanaṃ apacattha（他煮了饭）、pacattha 等，与主动态相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1902-10-22", "zh": "被动态：apacīyattha、pacīyattha，apaccattha、paccattha，apacīya、pacīya，apacīyā、pacīyā，apacca、pacca，apaccā、paccā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1902-23-32", "zh": "apacīyu、pacīyu，apacīyū、pacīyū，apaccu、paccu，apaccū、paccū 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1902-33-49", "zh": "依“māyoge ī āādī”规则，与 mā 连用时也用 ā 等词尾：mā bhavaṃ apaccattha 等。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1903-2-7", "zh": "同样，agacchattha、gacchattha 等，与前面的例子相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1903-8-19", "zh": "同样还有 agamattha、gamattha 等，aghammattha、ghammattha 等。（非今天过去时词尾的用法完）", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1904-2-16", "zh": "6. 未亲见的过去时用 a、u、e、ttha、a、mha、ttha、re、ttho、vho、i、mhe", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1905-2-8", "zh": "表示未亲眼见到、不包括今天在内的过去义时，动词词根之后加 a 等词尾。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1905-9-14", "zh": "akkha 就是诸根，在诸根之外的叫作 parokkha（未亲见）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1905-15-16", "zh": "规则中的 parokkhe 是它的处格形式。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "19-1905-17-29", "zh": "由于规则中说了“aparokkhesu”，这里不加 kya、la 等插入音。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1906-2-6", "zh": "5,71. 在 parokkhā 中也要重叠", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1907-2-9", "zh": "用 parokkhā 词尾时，词形的第一个单音节部分要重叠。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1907-10-23", "zh": "依“bhūssa vuk”等规则加 vuk，得 bhūva，重叠为 bhūva bhūva 时——", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1908-2-8", "zh": "5,75. 首辅音以外的辅音删除", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1909-2-10", "zh": "重叠时，前一部分中除了首辅音以外的辅音都要删除。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1910-2-5", "zh": "18. 前一部分变为 a", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1911-2-8", "zh": "在 a 等词尾之前，重叠后前一部分的 bhū 变为 a。", "confidence": 55}
